Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll carry on till we see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through, believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers. Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved we've made it to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if we can just get to the\Nsunny, we'll be sitting pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that was so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I could enjoy it as much as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's all slippery\Nnow. Oh, no. Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to safety, little fishies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke, Brooke, is that a mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's a mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not impressed. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It helps to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When Big Mom experiences her hunger\Npains, it is best to steer clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A blind frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop her unless\Nshe consumes what she craves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, no one is\Nsafe from her rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's unreachable in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems this time she desires\Na piece of wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't even get a bite at the tea\Nparty, so she's likely fixated on that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have ruined it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I did pull it off, though, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And hey, at least I got to have\Nplenty of yummy cake. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're eating it, mid-plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.92,0:04:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was super yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the sunny isn't much further.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if we're\Ngetting close or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This forest is so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you guys think that\Nwe're going the right way now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That river's kind of familiar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure the sunies should\Nbe right there on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that the bridge that\Ngot shattered by the crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't trust anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire forest is our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every step we take,\Nit's trying to fool us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're moving the landscape\Naround to throw us for a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This place may seem familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I highly doubt\Nthat this is the same spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola's Viva card won't get\Nus out of this one, sadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when Mama herself\Nis right on our heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All the more reason to keep laying that\Nbait down, though, Nami. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow Zeus to return to Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, there's truly no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, everybody, or she's gonna\Ncatch up to us! Good movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Meridius!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Zeus, why are you disobeying\NMama's orders? Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeus, look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a nice juicy weather egg full\Nof storm clouds with your name on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Sun guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have\Nburned up that tree guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our Lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna need to\Ntake me down some other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Government hockey's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worse than a logotype!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna burn all of you to a cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come help, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm busy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want one more bite\Nof Stormcloud for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,More.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get across the bridge, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a massifier, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A little juice to the\Nface does the job handily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be leaving here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to your final resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they beat us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The homies must have rearranged\Nthe entire landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I suppose that leaves\Nus with no other option.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's time to kick their asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pedro, I think I saw\Nyou five years ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly rabbits!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about yourself first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Knobla Shamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.48,0:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eagle bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, grab Kara. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind it, Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He devoured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My weather egg—it's inside Zeus. Now what\Nis that clown doing? This is a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,hey knock it off
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,hey we're over here sorry to\Nhave kept you guys waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Those don't look like our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the opposite, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, but I'm afraid\Nthat your friends aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,New screen tip-out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.08,0:14:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that Mama finished\Noff your friends with Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be here soon, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be serious, can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have survived. Yeah.\NDon't you worry? They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn shame you didn't get to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Such frivolous optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me, what will\Nhappen when no one shows up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to take the ship from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, if you want to\Nlickety-split in that submarine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind turning my\Nhead if it's only you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kong Fu fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny belongs to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wanna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No bones about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take back the\NSunny one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're about to take a licking. lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a full house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.26,0:16:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we get this show started? I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.22,0:16:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they're all okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's a lot to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's been a long time\Nsince we made a cake together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.62,0:16:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Budgie, I've told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat saved Loneless Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the least I can do to repay them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please chiffon—it's dangerous;\Nhe'll be worried sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You should come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave without you, ma ’am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know how dangerous it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving Lola, but\Nthat's just a hollow gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally pay them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The real test of character is\Nproving you mean what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But sweetheart, you're\Nalways a man of your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you understand right, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to promise me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't return, take care of Pez!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Jafar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back safely, male!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to help you, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And return home to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sis! I see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.06,0:17:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, were you even listening just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa-sanji is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa-sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa-sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running away like a rat! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My climb attack doesn't normally\Nshoot lightning that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It wiped them all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Big Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely that hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's most likely in that massive hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean we actually\Nknocked her out cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:18:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's definitely her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How is she alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have assumed\Nshe'd go down that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She's trying to get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's too deep and she's stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's run while we still can! Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that won't\Nkeep her busy for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Her hunger pangs won't\Nsubside on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's my king!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the ground's giving way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.52,0:20:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me my wedding cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's climbing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats, up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, Siobhan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, what'd you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to trick us again or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stop Mama's\Nhunger pangs with my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an obvious trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have tied\Nher up in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, but why is Siobhan with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she ran off with Benji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to start...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear Pudding, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pretty little face is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.30,0:21:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it together, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Big Mom's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, get to the point before\Neveryone here ends up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve death, you miserable idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.13,0:21:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you do make it out to sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will hunt your\Ncrew down in cold blood
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and watch you all sink\Ninto the murky depths!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. You're right. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.28,0:22:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mama believes that you\Nguys stole her big wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.54,0:22:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's completely fixated on\Nthat idea right now. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.70,0:22:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.12,0:22:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But as of right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama would chase you to\Nthe ends of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,just to get one bite\Nof that sweet dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Give up, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come stand at my side and savor\Nthis momentous occasion with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.74,0:22:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll watch your friends\Nperish in Mama's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.54,0:22:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you cut that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ruining the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you came here to torture\Nus, you can get lost, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, black-legged Sanji. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for nothing, but Pudding told me\Nyou're really good at making sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm first class at anything I make.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you have to help us bake a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The exact one Mama wants\Nso we can stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll help all of you guys\Nescape. But why? You were free.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.20,0:23:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I still owe you\None for saving Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll risk my life to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.72,0:23:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No complaints. Thanks a ton. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows if we'll survive or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll make one thing clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.62,0:23:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sheer luck that the cake I wanted\Nto bake is the same one Mama craves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.56,0:23:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And I just passed by\Nthis area by coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you people would be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.88,0:23:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't go thinking I\Ncame all the way here to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,stop her because I didn't\Nwant to see you all die,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.68,0:23:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you understand me? Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, back to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.90,0:23:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So where can we bake this cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:24:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All the ingredients we need\Ncan be found in Chocolatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is for the\Nthree of us to head there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.06,0:24:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,immediately and bake the\Ncake as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.26,0:24:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll carry it back by boat\Nand pass it to the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.34,0:24:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That should get it to Mama,\Nwho will no doubt be after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.70,0:24:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake will serve as a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to hold out\Nuntil we're finished baking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.28,0:24:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.46,0:24:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Be warned that once you set\Nsail, enemies will swarm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have faith that you'll\Nbe able to pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.27,0:24:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop on, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.40,0:24:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said I was giving you\Na lift, you pathetic dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.02,0:24:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.60,0:24:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.88,0:24:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, get out of the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:24:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.60,0:25:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,because I don't think anything short of a
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.36,0:25:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,perfect cake will put\Nan end to this rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.08,0:25:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'm going to leave you guys\Nfor now, but I promise I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.00,0:25:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.66,0:25:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.08,0:25:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.84,0:25:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pony! Ship on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's doing it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna tell me what the\Ntwo of you are doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'll meet up with you and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.14,0:25:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a promise, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.70,0:25:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.56,0:26:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.04,0:26:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.00,0:26:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.98,0:26:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry back to the Sunny now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.68,0:26:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.24,0:26:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, go back down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.14,0:27:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Head to where we were before, then\Nfly straight for the coastline.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.50,0:27:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.28,0:27:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.62,0:27:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all headed straight into a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.84,0:27:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.10,0:27:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nice, Pudding, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.80,0:27:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was certain we were\Nheaded towards the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.22,0:27:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose we've been fooled\Nyet again. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.62,0:27:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The coast is this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.10,0:27:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.76,0:27:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.36,0:27:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.54,0:27:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Memory filament!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.12,0:27:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, flashbacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.56,0:27:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I've got some\Ngroceries to pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.16,0:27:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My big brother busted me in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go for walkies, good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen my son in three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.10,0:27:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, where could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:27:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.98,0:28:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We must use this to our benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.66,0:28:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.32,0:28:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.96,0:28:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Memories from the soul's original owners\Nhave come flooding back to the homies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.78,0:28:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But just as a warning, the\Neffects won't last forever, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.90,0:28:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,While they're confused, they will\Nno longer be under mama's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.74,0:28:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So your crewmates and other allies\Ncan get out of the forest safely now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.78,0:28:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Pudding
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.50,0:28:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.84,0:28:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have you been there, Sanchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.42,0:28:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long, I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.62,0:28:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.58,0:28:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's head to Chocolat Town and\Nmake this cake Get off and swim, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.66,0:28:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are beautiful\Neven when you're angry
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.87,0:28:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.58,0:28:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.76,0:28:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pull that crap on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.44,0:28:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else I'll wring your\Nneck next time, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.56,0:28:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.94,0:29:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I see the coast\Nup ahead! Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.34,0:29:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.88,0:29:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you Karoo think Pudding\Nis really on our side now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.18,0:29:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm unsure,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.26,0:29:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but we'd better not let our guard down\Nuntil we're out of their territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.10,0:29:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.96,0:29:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.72,0:29:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's gotten into you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.28,0:29:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you go and attack us, you big dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.68,0:29:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I didn't really\Nhave a say in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.90,0:29:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear your dumb excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.22,0:29:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever let me catch you\Ndoing that again. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.30,0:29:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you. Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.64,0:29:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That lightning cloud shirt was tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.10,0:29:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to get another nibble. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.94,0:29:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been back a whole two minutes\Nand you're losing it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.44,0:30:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't disobey Mama again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.86,0:30:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.30,0:30:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.20,0:30:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my wedding cake. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.74,0:30:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.42,0:30:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.58,0:30:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.46,0:30:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That attack nearly got us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.86,0:30:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the save, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.32,0:30:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You were quite effective against\Nthe Chess Peacekeepers, Skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just catch on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.04,0:30:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Soul King, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.14,0:31:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.70,0:31:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where they're all coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.38,0:31:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Nami and Robin's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.52,0:31:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they'll get mad if we break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.18,0:31:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ask for forgiveness later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.22,0:31:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shatter it to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And who exactly are you\Ngoing to apologize to?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.12,0:31:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You did see the lightning\Nearlier, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.26,0:31:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew is on its last lickety leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.38,0:31:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's not too lickety
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.94,0:31:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,late to take me up on that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.64,0:31:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I made no matter how hard\Nyou try you'll never be
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.88,0:31:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,able to keep up with our\Nendless droves of soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.58,0:31:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll collapse long before the waves\Nstop pouring out of that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.46,0:31:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not an unreasonable man though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Submit now and I'll at\Nleast spare your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.42,0:31:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.98,0:31:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.20,0:31:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done talking to yourself yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.38,0:31:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish question!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.10,0:32:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I am tired of repeating myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.04,0:32:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you once again\Nto get off this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.86,0:32:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny belongs to\Nthe Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.30,0:32:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely certain you\Nwant to go down this path?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.94,0:32:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.24,0:32:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I to complain if my enemies\Ndon't happen to value their own lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.82,0:32:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're begging me, I shall give\Nyou both the sweet taste of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.22,0:32:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We can head straight to Kaku Island now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.40,0:32:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.22,0:33:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, isn't that your ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.64,0:33:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it looks like\Nthey're getting attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They set up an ambush woefully fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.78,0:33:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, my big brothers are there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be targeting Sanji's crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll teach ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.06,0:33:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.46,0:33:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They were no match for\Nmy darling brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.98,0:33:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have let those\Nweaklings defend for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.06,0:33:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, really back there? Pudding I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.76,0:33:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,believe i actually said all that out loud
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.28,0:33:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and what do you want to do\Nshould we drop you off down
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,there it's fine more important
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for me to help you all right
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.62,0:33:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're sure we'll just keep\Non moving forward then the
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.72,0:33:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,thing about my friends is You\Ndon't need to worry about them
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing those guys, they'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.56,0:34:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do this we're gonna\Nknock out big mom with this cake
